OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with clear spells leading to
OL,7,Fthe likelihood of areas of mist and
OL,8,Ffog developing overnight. Light winds.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average for the
OL,10,Ftime of year, but chilly in clearer
OL,11,Fareas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FOvernight mist and fog clears
OL,14,Fslowly through the morning to give a
OL,15,Freasonable afternoon with sunny
OL,16,Fspells. Fog likely to return
OL,17,Fovernight. Light winds. Mild by day,
OL,18,Fchilly overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
